  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1116000,
    "UIName": "Sea Fox",
    "Id": "chassisdef_sea_fox_SFOX-STD",
    "Name": "Sea Fox",
    "Details": "The Sea Fox amphibious battle armor is a niche unit, but one that excels within that niche; intended to operate underwater and equipped with a Clantech Underwater Maneuvering Unit capable of moving the suit at the same speed in shallow water as it could move on land, the Sea Fox is an excellent infiltrator and ambush fighter, capable of excelling in urban operations in areas where waterways are available for access.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.886</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can mount Omni units, can melee, can swarm.</b></color>",
